00:10:31,045 --> 00:10:34,796
市场会告诉你：‘你是赢家。’ 这里有1000美元
The market tells you, 'You are a winner.' There is a thousand dollars.

219
00:10:34,796 --> 00:10:36,238
这完全可以理解
Now, it is very understandable

220
00:10:39,297 --> 00:10:45,247
但如果你想培养心理素质，想拥有真正的优势和稳定性
However, if you are going to develop mental strength and you are going to develop a real edge and consistency,

221
00:10:45,247 --> 00:10:47,924
你就必须养成这些习惯
you are going to have to develop these habits.

222
00:10:47,924 --> 00:10:50,899
这一点无法回避
That is a fact. That is something you cannot avoid.

225
00:10:51,540 --> 00:10:55,490
如果你培养出心理韧性并养成习惯，更重要的是，你将能享受到更多交易的乐趣。
If you develop the mental strength and you develop the habits,

226
00:10:55,490 --> 00:11:01,235
more importantly, what you are going to get to do is have a lot more fun.

227
00:11:01,236 --> 00:11:01,595
好的。
Okay.

228
00:11:04,829 --> 00:11:09,497
你将变得更高效、更稳定、更盈利。
you are going to become far more effective, more consistent, and more profitable.

231
00:11:09,500 --> 00:11:16,988
好的，去做大多数人不做的事，大多数人无法坚持完成足迹图模板并养成习惯。
Okay, so do those things that not many do, and not many complete their templates consistently and habitually.

233
00:11:16,988 --> 00:11:19,900
现在，我们进入策略部分。
Now, let’s move into the strategy.

234
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:22,732
核心是关键拍卖反转。
This is all about key auction reversals.

235
00:11:22,732 --> 00:11:25,883
在第三单元我们已详细讨论过,当时讲解了带影线的拍卖高点或低点的概念。
We did speak about this quite extensively in Unit 3

236
00:11:25,883 --> 00:11:30,085
when we went over the concept of a well-auctioned high or low.

237
00:11:30,437 --> 00:11:32,538
现在我们称之为尾部拍卖。
now we call these tail auctions.

238
00:11:32,920 --> 00:11:35,267
我会再简单回顾一下。
Again, briefly, I’m going to go over that.

239
00:11:35,267 --> 00:11:40,007
简单来说，尾部拍卖就是出现一个非常长的影线，可能在上方或下方。
Very simply put, a tail auction is where we just get a very big wick

240
00:11:40,007 --> 00:11:42,535
either to the upside or to the downside.

241
00:11:42,535 --> 00:11:45,379
这就是尾部拍卖的由来。
That’s where it comes from—a tail auction.

242
00:11:45,620 --> 00:11:48,810
我们之前提到，这种尾部拍卖，往往预示着潜在的低点或高点，并且通常会维持几个交易时段。
And we said when we get these types of tail auctions,

243
00:11:48,810 --> 00:11:51,420
they do tend to signal potential lows and highs

244
00:11:51,420 --> 00:11:54,320
and they tend to hold for a couple of sessions.

246
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:57,720
但我们当时没有深入讲解如何执行，如何参与其中，如何识别它们，以及机会在哪里。
Now, we didn’t quite go into how to execute,

247
00:11:57,720 --> 00:12:01,120
how to get involved in them, how to identify them

248
00:12:01,120 --> 00:12:02,820
and where the opportunity is.

249
00:12:02,900 --> 00:12:07,532
而这就是本次策略课程的核心。
And that’s what the strategy session is going to be all about.

250
00:12:07,532 --> 00:12:10,739
现在，最重要的当然是形态。
Now, the most important thing is obviously the shape.

252
00:12:11,020 --> 00:12:14,740
我们称之为V型或倒V型反转。
We call this a V or an inverse V reversal.

254
00:12:14,740 --> 00:12:20,609
这个名称的由来很简单：主动性交易推动价格向下。
The name comes very simply: We get initiative into a lower price.

255
00:12:20,609 --> 00:12:23,543
在低点形成前，我们通常会看到大量吸收，也就是所谓的被动响应买盘。
Just before the low is found,

256
00:12:23,543 --> 00:12:28,433
we tend to get a really high amount of absorption

257
00:12:28,433 --> 00:12:31,856
or what’s known as responsive buying.

258
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:36,360
随后市场会触及某个价格点位。
The market then runs into a certain price point.

259
00:12:36,500 --> 00:12:38,657
注意：这个价格点位无法预先确定。
Now, note: this price point is not definable.

260
00:12:38,657 --> 00:12:42,432
任何认为能精准抄底或抄顶的人
Anyone who thinks they can pick a top and the bottom of a market

261
00:12:42,432 --> 00:12:44,858
并不理解市场背后的核心原理。
doesn’t understand the underlying principles behind the market.

263
00:12:44,860 --> 00:12:49,287
并非是因为某个简单的价格，
It’s not that a simple price—or that a price...

264
00:12:49,287 --> 00:12:54,519
也并非价格本身导致市场反转。
It’s not that a price is the reason a market turns around.

265
00:12:54,820 --> 00:13:01,700
市场在此价格反转的原因是买家决定发起主动性交易
The reason the market turns around at this price is because a buyer decides to initiate. That influences a buyer.

267
00:13:02,020 --> 00:13:06,460
可能是大型养老基金，也可能是投资基金、对冲基金，无论是什么机构。
It could be a big pension fund. It could be an investment fund, a hedge fund—whatever it might be.

269
00:13:06,700 --> 00:13:10,549
现在，他为何开始主动发起交易的原因和逻辑，我们无法知晓，也永远不会知道，对吧？
Now, the reasons and the logic behind Why he begins to initiate,

270
00:13:10,549 --> 00:13:13,757
that's beyond us, okay? We're never going to know why.

271
00:13:14,180 --> 00:13:17,986
那为何要浪费时间和精力寻找价格？试图找到低点和反转点？其实你只需采用流程：识别潜在反转点前的价格响应。
So why spend our time and energy trying to find prices

272
00:13:17,986 --> 00:13:21,792
and try to find the low points and the turning points,

273
00:13:21,792 --> 00:13:28,367
when we can simply adopt the process where we identify the price response prior to a potential turning point.

274
00:13:28,370 --> 00:13:34,660
在足迹图上识别其他几种响应类型，然后据此执行交易。
We identify on the footprint a few other types of responses and then we simply execute on that.

279
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:40,808
好的，这又回到整个核心概念，即主观猜测市场可能在哪个价格反转，还是基于事实观察并据此执行交易。
Okay, that brings us back to the whole concept again of having a subjective opinion,

280
00:13:40,808 --> 00:13:44,878
which is guessing at which price the market might turn around at,

281
00:13:44,878 --> 00:13:48,609
or looking at the facts and executing based on the facts.

282
00:13:48,612 --> 00:13:54,719
好的，现在来看该策略中的其他原则。
Okay, now let's go through some of the other principles that you're going to find in this strategy.

286
00:13:54,940 --> 00:13:56,580
我会用图形标注来说明。
I'm just going to graphically annotate them.

287
00:13:57,020 --> 00:14:01,780
显然，这被称为主动性交易转向主动性交易。
So obviously, this is known as initiative to initiative.

288
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:07,640
我们之前提过。通常会看到市场以趋势方式主动发起交易，对吧？
We spoke about this. So we tend to see the market initiate in a trend-like fashion, okay?

290
00:14:07,640 --> 00:14:11,380
下跌过程中自然会遇到被动买家。
It will run into obviously responsive buyers on the way down.

291
00:14:11,500 --> 00:14:15,470
为什么？因为价格下跌时，会有买家做出被动响应。
Why? Because as price moves lower, you're going to have a response from buyers.

292
00:14:15,470 --> 00:14:21,460
最终，价格会到达某个点位，出现反向的主动性交易。
Eventually, it will reach a certain price point where we will see initiation in the opposite direction.

294
00:14:22,280 --> 00:14:24,580
注意，这在第三单元已提及。
Now note, we said this in Unit 3.

295
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:29,499
最重要的因素之一是，当出现反向主动性交易时，通常会在上涨途中形成小型或区域性的吸收口袋定位。
One of the most important factors is when we get that initiation in the opposite direction,

296
00:14:29,499 --> 00:14:33,717
you tend to get little pockets or pocket positioning of absorption on the way up.

299
00:14:34,020 --> 00:14:37,920
我们称之为被动卖出或二次被动卖出。
Okay, we call this responsive selling or secondary responsive selling.

300
00:14:38,040 --> 00:14:40,820
为什么？很简单。
Why? Well, it's simple. Obviously, in this down move,

301
00:14:40,880 --> 00:14:45,740
在这段下跌中，可能有部分交易者被套。
in this first little move down, you're likely to have a couple of people caught along.

303
00:14:45,740 --> 00:14:49,760
当市场最终反弹时，他们只是试图平仓离场。
When the market finally bounces, they're simply trying to get out of those positions.

305
00:14:50,420 --> 00:14:54,464
同样，在市场下跌过程中，可能有参与者尝试摊薄成本。
Equally, as the market's been going down, you might have had participants trying to average.

306
00:14:54,464 --> 00:14:57,699
尝试加仓时，只需更好地管理这些头寸
Trying to buy more, just manage those positions a little bit better.

308
00:14:57,980 --> 00:15:02,046
同样，当市场反弹时，他们往往会平仓
Again, when that market bounces, they tend to get out of those positions.

309
00:15:02,046 --> 00:15:05,799
你还会发现新的潜在空头在市场最终反弹时入场
You also get new potential shorts entering where the market finally bounces.

311
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:09,500
最后，还会有一些获利了结
And last but not least, you get a little bit of profit-taking.

313
00:15:10,020 --> 00:15:14,096
部分人可能会在低点买入并寻找小目标
Some might buy the low and look for small targets.

314
00:15:14,096 --> 00:15:20,618
这就是主动性交易向下再向上的基本前提
That's the basic premise of the initiative to the downside and initiative again to the upside.

317
00:15:22,180 --> 00:15:30,260
现在注意，这会看起来更像趋势行情，流动性会明显不足
Now, note this will look a lot more trend-like. There is going to be a real lack of liquidity.

319
00:15:30,460 --> 00:15:39,060
主动性交易本质上意味着需要成交量或交易活动
Initiative, by definition, means that there is volume or business required.

321
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:45,682
有交易需要完成，而这需要成交量
There’s business to be done and that requires volume.

322
00:15:45,682 --> 00:15:52,796
流动性的供给将决定价格波动的范围
If liquidity is being provided, that will determine how big the range will be.

323
00:15:52,796 --> 00:16:00,419
流动性越充足，市场主动发起的价格区间越小，反之亦然
The more liquidity provided, the fewer prices the market will initiate over—and vice versa.

325
00:16:00,980 --> 00:16:04,552
在平衡或失衡的拍卖足迹过程中你会发现，在主动性下跌过程中可能会出现一些失衡区
In terms of a balanced or imbalanced auction footprint process,

326
00:16:04,552 --> 00:16:09,553
what you tend to find is that on the way down with the initiative,

327
00:16:09,553 --> 00:16:11,696
you might find pockets of imbalance.

329
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:16,660
同样，当市场反转向上时一旦我们清理掉这些小的头寸分布区你可能也会在相反方向发现一些失衡区
Equally, once the market reverses upward,

330
00:16:16,660 --> 00:16:23,260
Once we take out those little pockets of positioning, as explained earlier,

331
00:16:23,260 --> 00:16:29,310
you then might also find some imbalances in the opposite direction.

332
00:16:29,310 --> 00:16:39,760
现在注意，我们在之前的单元中已讨论过失衡区及其填补方式
Now, do note, we did speak in earlier units about imbalances and how they tend to get filled out.

334
00:16:39,760 --> 00:16:42,673
所以，如果在主动性交易的第一段出现失衡别惊讶市场在回升时会停下来并在回升过程中填补这个失衡区
So, if there is an imbalance on the first leg of initiative,

335
00:16:42,673 --> 00:16:46,072
don’t be surprised for the market to stop on the way back up

336
00:16:46,072 --> 00:16:48,500
and fill out that imbalance on the way back up.

337
00:16:48,502 --> 00:16:53,359
稍后我们会详细讨论如何利用这一点进行执行
Again, we will talk a little bit about this and how we can utilize this for execution in a bit.

340
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:57,117
现在，就一些关键指标而言
Now, in terms of some of the key metrics,

341
00:16:57,117 --> 00:16:59,622
显然，在上下文中
obviously, in terms of the context

342
00:16:59,622 --> 00:17:03,379
你可能会发现这种主动性交易的价格反应
where you could find this initiative-to-initiative price response,

343
00:17:05,764 --> 00:17:07,692
这是首先需要注意的
That’s the first thing to note.

344
00:17:07,692 --> 00:17:10,998
这通常出现在市场处于失衡状态时
It does tend to come when markets are in an imbalanced state.

345
00:17:10,998 --> 00:17:13,478
换句话说，市场会达到某个点位
In other words, the markets get to a point

346
00:17:21,502 --> 00:17:24,879
在这个例子中，这是折价区
In this example, this would be a discount,

347
00:17:25,920 --> 00:17:29,965
或者在这个例子中，市场处于真正的溢价区
or in this example, the market’s at a real premium.

348
00:17:29,965 --> 00:17:35,848
市场会达到一个真正的折价区或溢价区的点位因此会在反方向触发主动性交易
The market reaches a point where we are at a real discount or a real premium,

349
00:17:35,848 --> 00:17:39,157
and therefore we get initiation in the opposite direction.

350
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:43,378
这通常发生在市场不再处于失衡状态时
This does tend to come when markets are no longer imbalanced.

351
00:17:43,378 --> 00:17:49,129
根据失衡的定义，市场处于价格发现模式正在探索一系列新的价格水平
By the definition of imbalance, it means the markets are in a price discovery mode

352
00:17:49,129 --> 00:17:52,196
and they are discovering a series of prices.

353
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:54,915
现在，关于成交量和Delta需要关注的点：你会在下跌段和上涨段都看到高成交量或者在第一段和第二段都看到高成交量
Now, some of the things to pay attention to in terms of volume and delta:

354
00:17:54,915 --> 00:17:57,449
you will see high volume on both the down leg and the up leg,

355
00:17:57,449 --> 00:17:58,716
or both leg one and leg two.

356
00:18:01,350 --> 00:18:05,732
这一点显而易见，因为主动性交易正如我们在主动性驱动单元中讨论的主动性交易本身就代表市场有交易活动，即成交量高
This is obvious simply because we know that with initiative,

357
00:18:05,732 --> 00:18:13,182
as we spoke about in the unit on initiative drives, initiative simply means business in the market

358
00:18:13,182 --> 00:18:14,935
and, by definition, volume.

359
00:18:14,940 --> 00:18:20,358
现在，当我们在某一方向发起主动性交易时如之前所述，我们可能会留下失衡区或者我们所谓的低量节点
Now, as we are obviously initiating in one direction,

360
00:18:20,358 --> 00:18:26,980
We have got the potential, as mentioned, to leave either imbalances

361
00:18:26,980 --> 00:18:30,592
or what we call low-volume areas.

362
00:18:30,592 --> 00:18:39,020
显然，Delta会在趋势方向上累积
And, obviously, as mentioned, the delta will accumulate in the direction of the trend.

363
00:18:39,280 --> 00:18:43,764
因此，当价格上涨且主动买盘发起时，Delta应转为正向
So, as prices are rising and we're initiating, we should see the delta go positive to the upside.

365
00:18:43,764 --> 00:18:45,259
一旦主动性交易推动价格至某点
Once we run into that initiative,

366
00:18:53,247 --> 00:18:55,039
Delta应会趋于平缓，几乎持平
The delta should flatline, effectively.

367
00:18:55,039 --> 00:18:59,879
当我们转向并开始在反方向发起主动性交易时我们希望再次看到Delta的变化
Once we then turn back over and begin to initiate in the opposite direction,

368
00:18:59,879 --> 00:19:02,299
again, we like to see the delta.

369
00:19:04,440 --> 00:19:10,103
好的，关于Delta，当我们从顶部开始发起时我们希望先看到下跌过程中有被动买盘响应
Okay, so in terms of the delta, as we begin to initiate off the top,

370
00:19:10,103 --> 00:19:15,389
we like to first run into, again, some responsive buying on the way down.

372
00:19:15,391 --> 00:19:18,724
注意：这种情况下，由于有买家响应这意味着最终卖盘可能多于买盘
Now, note: in this instance, because we have buyers responding,

373
00:19:18,724 --> 00:19:23,391
it means that there is going to be likely more selling ultimately than buying.

375
00:19:23,393 --> 00:19:29,218
因此，反转后你可能会看到更深的红色阴影
So, what you're going to see potentially once we turn over is you're going to see darker shades of red.

377
00:19:29,218 --> 00:19:32,521
好的，我们等会在图表上展示
Okay, so we will show this on the charts in a minute.

378
00:19:32,521 --> 00:19:36,099
但最终，你会看到响应时出现更深的红色阴影
But ultimately, you're going to see darker shades as we see that response.

380
00:19:36,660 --> 00:19:39,482
接着，我们会看到Delta开始反转
Again, we're going to then start to see the delta flip over.

381
00:19:39,482 --> 00:19:41,599
Delta会开始转为负值
So, we'll see the delta start to turn negative.

382
00:19:42,040 --> 00:19:46,380
显然，随着反转进行，Delta会持续增加
And, obviously, that delta will pick up an increase as we reverse.

384
00:19:46,380 --> 00:19:48,945
现在，这对累计买卖差的意义显然在于我们可能会从正累计买卖差转向平衡状态最终可能变为负累计买卖差
Now, what that means for the cumulative delta, obviously,

385
00:19:48,945 --> 00:19:52,650
is we may go from a positive cumulative delta toward a flat delta

386
00:19:52,650 --> 00:19:54,360
and then eventually a negative delta.

387
00:19:54,360 --> 00:20:00,950
好的，接下来关注其他关键要点
Okay. Now, in terms of some of the other key things to focus on,

388
00:20:00,950 --> 00:20:07,540
最后一个重要原则是颜色线条
the last real principle we want to spend time on is the color line.

390
00:20:07,540 --> 00:20:15,640
另外，如第3单元所述，你会发现我倾向于用蓝色线标记这些关键拍卖反转
Again, what we do note, as mentioned in Unit 3, I like to use blue lines for these key auction reversals.

393
00:20:16,100 --> 00:20:20,920
原因在于，它们标识出市场中的重要转折点
The reason being, they signal very important turning points in the markets.

394
00:20:21,060 --> 00:20:23,680
在接下来的几个例子中我会展示它们还能为我们提供绝佳的突破机会当价格最终回测这些区域时
Again, as I’ll show you in the next couple of examples,

395
00:20:23,680 --> 00:20:25,645
they also provide us with very good breakout opportunities

396
00:20:25,645 --> 00:20:26,736
when we finally revisit them.

398
00:20:33,640 --> 00:20:39,006
现在，我们继续讨论其他原则还有几个重要的概念需要分享很多交易者都会问：为什么K线会有影线？
Now, the next thing I want to move on to

399
00:20:39,006 --> 00:20:43,836
is to discuss a few of the other principles.

400
00:20:43,836 --> 00:20:52,959
One of the big questions many traders ask themselves is, Why does a candlestick have a tail?

402
00:20:56,110 --> 00:21:01,290
这对交易策略至关重要，我稍后会解释
This is quite key to the trade strategy, which I’ll explain in a minute.

404
00:21:01,350 --> 00:21:06,120
过去，我们只能依靠K线图而没有足迹图，只能看到影线
In the past, when we only had the use of candlesticks—

405
00:21:06,120 --> 00:21:10,456
and not footprints— all we’d see was this tail.

406
00:21:10,458 --> 00:21:16,530
无法看到买卖交互的具体过程
We wouldn’t be able to see what physically happened in terms of interaction.

410
00:21:16,790 --> 00:21:26,820
而交互过程对下一步走势至关重要
the interaction is imperative to the next move.

412
00:21:29,000 --> 00:21:38,240
我的意思是，如果影线伴随高负Delta
So, what I mean by that is, if we get, as a result of that tail, a high negative delta,

