00:22:02,267 --> 00:22:04,940
I don’t mean necessarily closing on the extreme,

419
00:22:04,940 --> 00:22:07,019
I just mean a relatively large wick.

420
00:22:07,140 --> 00:22:09,543
若这三个条件都满足，这表示第二天很可能沿影线方向继续运行
If we get these three principles,

421
00:22:09,543 --> 00:22:13,949
this signals to us that there is a very high probability

422
00:22:13,949 --> 00:22:19,157
the next day you're likely to continue in the direction of the tail.

423
00:22:19,640 --> 00:22:21,256
这一点非常重要，因为传统教材会告诉你或旧思维会认为，看到影线或长影线时直接做空，价格就会继续下跌
This is so important, because typically

