00:22:21,256 --> 00:22:25,027
what textbooks would teach you, or the old way of thinking would teach you,

425
00:22:25,027 --> 00:22:29,336
was when you saw one of these wicks or tails, you simply sell and it continues.

427
00:22:29,760 --> 00:22:32,364
