00:22:32,364 --> 00:22:36,595
where we do have a key auction reversal, but in fact it fails,

429
00:22:38,874 --> 00:22:41,478
我来解释其中的原因。
I'm going to show you the reason why.

431
00:22:41,480 --> 00:22:47,809
在学习策略时，一定要在下一个交易时段前回顾前一交易日的收盘情况。
When you learn the strategy, always look at the end of the day before the next trading session.

433
00:22:47,809 --> 00:22:49,919
是否出现了高额负Delta？
Was there a high negative delta?

434
00:22:50,640 --> 00:22:55,100
在这个例子中，显然是正Delta，如果这是买盘的尾部拍卖。
In this example, obviously a positive delta, if it was a buying tail.

436
00:22:55,640 --> 00:22:59,700
是否有相对较高的日内成交量？为什么需要这个条件？
Was there high relative daily volume? Why do we require that?

437
00:22:59,820 --> 00:23:03,447
我们正从主动性交易转向另一个主动性交易。
We’re going from initiative to initiative.

438
00:23:03,447 --> 00:23:08,629
根据定义，主动性交易转向主动性交易时成交量应非常高。
By definition, initiative to initiative should have really high volume.

439
00:23:08,629 --> 00:23:11,738
第三，我们需要一个弱势收盘。
Third, we need a weak close.

440
00:23:11,880 --> 00:23:19,487
如果没有弱势收盘，即没有以相对较长的影线收盘，这说明市场仅是轻微延伸，而非真正出现关键拍卖反转。
If we don’t get a weak close, i.e., if we don’t close with a relatively large tail,

441
00:23:19,487 --> 00:23:24,051
that’s telling you the market was just extended a little bit,

442
00:23:24,051 --> 00:23:28,235
rather than actually seeing some form of a key auction reversal.

446
00:23:28,240 --> 00:23:37,400
当反转出现时，你会发现流动性有所减少。
What you’ll notice when we get the reversal is a little thinning out of liquidity.

449
00:23:37,400 --> 00:23:40,180
这是我们的关键价格点位。
This is our key price point.

450
00:23:40,380 --> 00:23:46,415
现在，一旦跌破这个初始被动响应区域，年复一年会发生什么？
Now, once we get below this initial responsive area, What happens from year to year?

